WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.614 --> 00:00:02.253
- [Voiceover] Dating can be difficult.

00:00:02.253 --> 00:00:03.951
- [Voiceover] Especially
when you meet all different

00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:04.784
types of people.

00:00:04.784 --> 00:00:08.284
(upbeat percussion music)

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.856
- Come on, one more drink.

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:13.758
- [Voiceover] Meet the Tourist.

00:00:13.758 --> 00:00:15.979
The Tourist says she's bisexual.

00:00:15.979 --> 00:00:18.236
Well, after three drinks she is.

00:00:18.236 --> 00:00:20.092
She won't hesitate to make
out for the sake of that

00:00:20.092 --> 00:00:23.494
good old college experimentation.

00:00:23.494 --> 00:00:25.949
But even after a month
of nights spent together

00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:28.113
anything below the fanny
pack and it's suddenly. . .

00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:30.605
- Oh, can we just keep making out?

00:00:30.605 --> 00:00:32.094
- [Voiceover] Or . . .

00:00:32.094 --> 00:00:33.555
- Donde estas el bano?

00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:35.143
Ha ha.

00:00:35.143 --> 00:00:36.412
- [Voiceover] It becomes
abundantly clear that she's

00:00:36.412 --> 00:00:40.495
only a tourist here and
not a permanent resident.

00:00:41.394 --> 00:00:43.227
- You're gonna order a

00:00:44.728 --> 00:00:45.653
rum and coke.

00:00:45.653 --> 00:00:47.659
- [Voiceover] Meet the Psychic.

00:00:47.659 --> 00:00:49.076
He's someone who thinks
he knows you better than

00:00:49.076 --> 00:00:50.272
you know yourself.

00:00:50.272 --> 00:00:53.088
He'll try to predict your
sexuality before you do.

00:00:53.088 --> 00:00:53.921
He'll tell you that he was . . .

00:00:53.921 --> 00:00:55.136
- Was once bisexual too.

00:00:55.136 --> 00:00:55.969
- [Voiceover] And . . .

00:00:55.969 --> 00:00:57.252
- We all go through that phase.

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:58.718
- [Voiceover] And eventually he'll be able

00:00:58.718 --> 00:01:00.119
to predict the future.

00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:02.036
- I see you leaving me.

00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:04.134
Wait, what?

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:10.144
- [Voiceover] The Jack
Tripper believes that three's

00:01:10.144 --> 00:01:12.064
company is a motto to live by.

00:01:12.064 --> 00:01:14.304
He thinks that your sexuality
means that you're always

00:01:14.304 --> 00:01:16.370
down for a threesome and
ready to jump in the sack

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:19.254
with any girl as long as he's there.

00:01:19.254 --> 00:01:21.171
- Yeah, chemistry here.

00:01:22.005 --> 00:01:23.172
It's palpable.

00:01:24.243 --> 00:01:27.002
(upbeat quirky music)

00:01:27.002 --> 00:01:28.209
- [Voiceover] Going out
will always result in him

00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:31.526
asking you if we can take home That Girl.

00:01:31.526 --> 00:01:33.499
Or, That Girl.

00:01:33.499 --> 00:01:34.666
Or, That Girl.

00:01:38.566 --> 00:01:41.025
- [Voiceover] The Detective
is always on the job

00:01:41.025 --> 00:01:42.862
and always suspicious of you.

00:01:42.862 --> 00:01:44.570
You'll find her constantly
interrogating you about

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:45.828
your sexuality.

00:01:45.828 --> 00:01:48.066
- What percent straight are you?

00:01:48.066 --> 00:01:49.291
- [Voiceover] She'll ask, or . . .

00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:50.462
- So what do you call yourself?

00:01:50.462 --> 00:01:51.295
- [Voiceover] Or . . .

00:01:51.295 --> 00:01:53.059
- If you had to choose
between men and women,

00:01:53.059 --> 00:01:55.015
who would you choose?!

00:01:55.015 --> 00:01:57.992
- Have I told you the one about
how we faked a moon landing?

00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:59.586
- [Voiceover] There's
the Conspiracy Theorist.

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:01.960
She has clearly been burned
before and she's convinced

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.755
that you'll leave her for a man.

00:02:03.755 --> 00:02:05.834
Which, to her, is more
devastating than leaving her

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.057
for a woman.

00:02:07.057 --> 00:02:08.605
- I dated a bisexual once.

00:02:08.605 --> 00:02:10.022
He cheated on me.

00:02:11.282 --> 00:02:12.815
They always cheat.

00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:15.111
- [Voiceover] She has major
trust issues and has somehow

00:02:15.111 --> 00:02:17.997
managed to link fidelity to
sexuality all while wearing

00:02:17.997 --> 00:02:19.678
a tin foil hat and yelling . . .

00:02:19.678 --> 00:02:23.796
- Tupac Shakur is alive and he
is living in Tucson, Arizona!

00:02:23.796 --> 00:02:25.834
He is keeping it tight.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:28.607
- You see, you would look a lot
better if you leaned against

00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:31.871
the bar and then bit
your finger, like this.

00:02:31.871 --> 00:02:32.964
- [Voiceover] Meet the Director.

00:02:32.964 --> 00:02:35.215
He is the guy who will tell
you how to act in public.

00:02:35.215 --> 00:02:36.602
If you're not acting gay enough for him,

00:02:36.602 --> 00:02:39.496
he'll tell you what to do,
what to say, where to stand,

00:02:39.496 --> 00:02:42.150
how to stand, and keep you
going until you've given

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:44.639
an Oscar winning performance
convincing all of his friends

00:02:44.639 --> 00:02:46.401
you're something that you're not.

00:02:46.401 --> 00:02:47.745
- Oh that's great!

00:02:47.745 --> 00:02:48.847
And, cut!

00:02:48.847 --> 00:02:50.193
We got it guys!

00:02:50.193 --> 00:02:53.618
Let's go to the Oscars, I will drive.

00:02:53.618 --> 00:02:55.609
- [Voiceover] And just
when you've given up hope

00:02:55.609 --> 00:02:58.109
you finally meet the Ultimate.

00:02:59.618 --> 00:03:01.413
They get you no matter what.

00:03:01.413 --> 00:03:03.830
And love you for who you are.

00:03:05.028 --> 00:03:09.475
And you realize this has all
been building up to them.

00:03:09.475 --> 00:03:12.392
(light airy music)

